      "pause when messages conflict or when the draft would create a refund, legal, pricing, delivery, or account promise. For reconcile a promised customer follow-up date before another assistant message, the assistant records what was observed and leaves interpretation or consequential approval with the named owner. A second reviewer should be able to reproduce the handoff without opening unrelated private material.",
